WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Check the tenant scope
This filter controls which tenants you are reviewing. Confirm it before
comparing figures or investigating a record.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Choose a reporting period
Today, 7 days and 30 days change period-based figures. Zero today does
not mean there are no older orders.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Connect an order to its purchase
The list links each order to its invoice, tenant and vendor. Open the
record to investigate; platform order access is read-only.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Review teams and partners
Customers, Tenancy and Marketplace lead to the people and organizations
behind the purchase. Approval and staff access are separate workflows.

